Package: bcmlrNET
Type: Package
Title: Generalized Bayesian Changepoint Analysis for Dynamic Networks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Yuhui", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "yuhuicw@gmail.com")
Description: Generalized Bayesian analysis of changes in a sequence of
    undirected networks. Fits a specified number of changepoints using
    Gibbs sampling, selects the number through posterior AUC summaries,
    and provides uncertainty summaries and visualizations at network,
    dyad and node levels. Computationally intensive network updates are
    implemented in C++ through 'Rcpp' and 'RcppArmadillo'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
