    Rcpp,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    grDevices,
    graphics,
    grid,
    methods,
    rlang,
    scales,
    stats,
    utils,
    pROC
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo
Suggests:
    matrixStats,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: C++17
